{"id":"tradition","lemma":"tradition","pos":"noun","rank":2300,"glosses":["tradition","a type of baguette or French stick"],"ipa":"/tʁa.di.sjɔ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/89/Fr-tradition.ogg/Fr-tradition.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"traditions"},"formAudio":{"traditions":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7d/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-traditions.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"C'est une tradition stupide.","en":"It's a stupid tradition.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"stupid"}]},{"text":"Vous devez respecter nos traditions.","en":"You need to respect our traditions.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},{"g":"to respect"},{"g":"our","l":"notre"},null]},{"text":"Il a connaissance de la tradition.","en":"He is acquainted with the custom.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"knowledge"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"of the"]]},{"text":"Cette tradition date de temps immémoriaux.","en":"This custom dates from ancient times.","words":[{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},null,{"g":"date"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"time"},null]},{"text":"Nous devons maintenir les traditions familiales.","en":"We must keep up the family traditions.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},{"g":"to maintain"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"family","l":"familial"}]}]}